	(text "UA6 BLACK-BOX TEST RIG (galdumper shield)\n=========================================\nPassives you still need to add in KiCad:\n  R1..R22 = 470 ohm  (series R between each MCP GPIO and the matching UA6 pin -\n                      short the two named nets through the R)\n  R23,R24 = 10k pull-ups on U1_NRESET, U2_NRESET (to +5V)\n  R25,R26 = 4k7 pull-ups on SDA, SCL (to +5V)\n  R27     = 10k pull-up on Q1 gate (to +5V)\n  R28     = 4k7 series from VCC_CTRL to Q2 gate\n  C1,C2   = 100n MCP VDD decoupling (U1, U2)\n  C3      = 100n UA6 VCC decoupling (across SK1 pins 24 and 12)\n  C4      = 10uF bulk near +5V rail\n\nVCC switch on UA6 (add Q1 + Q2 in KiCad):\n  Q1  P-ch MOSFET, S=+5V, D=+5V_UA6, G=Q1_GATE\n  Q2  N-ch 2N7000, S=GND, D=Q1_GATE, G= via R28 from VCC_CTRL\n  R27 from Q1_GATE to +5V (default OFF)\n\nOptional:\n  LED + 330R on any spare Uno digital = \"sweep running\" indicator\n  LED + 330R across +5V_UA6/GND       = \"UA6 powered\" indicator\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 212.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
